sequenceDiagram
    actor Human as Human
    participant UI as UI or SDK
    participant API as API
    participant RT as Agent Editing Runtime
    participant IDX as Multimodal context and index
    participant POL as Policy Engine
    participant OP as Operation Engine
    participant Q as BullMQ
    participant W as Worker
    participant QC as Quality Control
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Human->>UI: Natural-language instruction
    UI->>API: Create AgentSession
    API->>RT: understand(instruction, constraints)
    RT->>IDX: inspect project, media, and transcript
    IDX-->>RT: evidence with time, model, and confidence
    RT->>RT: generate structured plan
    RT->>OP: simulate atomic operations
    OP-->>RT: diff, duration, alerts, and cost
    RT->>POL: check permissions, budget, and approval
    POL-->>UI: Plan awaiting approval
    Human->>UI: Approve or reject
    UI->>API: Plan approval
    API->>RT: execute plan
    RT->>OP: apply operation with preconditions
    OP->>DB: transaction, log, and projection
    OP-->>RT: result and inverse operation
    RT->>Q: analysis/render/QC jobs
    Q->>W: execute idempotent job
    W-->>DB: progress, logs, artifacts, and metrics
    W->>QC: validate output
    QC-->>RT: quality report
    RT-->>UI: changes, reasons, confidence, and alerts
    UI-->>Human: result, timeline, undo, and export
